  message: "Filed from INV-kahig closure. Sequencing note for whoever takes this: read WI-fagit (PR #689) FIRST. It is the one place in this repo where the dst choice was already litigated on bakeoff evidence, and it moved csharp OFF the class node because anchoring there conflated \"referenced as a type\" with \"instantiated\" and broke reverse-slice. Option A here is the same move for python, so WI-fagit is either the precedent or the counterexample, and it is cheaper to read than to rediscover."  # 4896
